
.TH Make 3 "" "Odoc" "OCaml Library"
.SH Name
Oxcaml_impl\.Include_functor_kind\.Make
.SH Synopsis
.sp 
.in 2
\fBModule Include_functor_kind\.Make\fR
.in 
.sp 
.fi 
A kind abbreviation reaching the functor through its argument\. T\.k is rendered as plain text: it is a reference through the parameter, which the wrapper the functor is applied to does not bind\.
.nf 
.SH Documentation
.sp 
.nf 
.sp 
.in 3
\fB1 Parameters\fR
.in 
.sp 
\f[CB]module\fR T : \f[CB]sig\fR
.br 
.ti +2
\f[CB]kind_\fR k
.br 
\f[CB]end\fR
.sp 
.in 3
\fB2 Signature\fR
.in 
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR inherited : T\.k
